丰密一句话教程：小狐狸🦊打开</span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="https://bridge.botanixlabs.dev/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">bridge.botanixlabs.dev</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">自动配置网络🛜，复制显示的btc地址到领水网站</span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="https://faucet.mutinynet.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">faucet.mutinynet.com</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">，领水成功后跳转有一条HASH，点进去复制，粘贴到Register Transaction ID，然后claim，之后去参与下面的各类生态dapp，如果实在不懂，跟着</span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="https://botanixlabs.xyz/en/testnet" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">botanixlabs.xyz/en/testnet</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> 点击查看教程，部署代币可以看文档教程里面有Ethereum Remix教你如何部署代币。
另外也可以参与下面的大使计划，附带详细的教程</span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="https://www.botanixlabs.xyz/en/ambassadors" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">botanixlabs.xyz/en/ambassadors</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">

